<title>USA: U.S. aluminum stocks lower in Oct - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. aluminum stocks lower in Oct - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. aluminum stocks held by integrated and non-integrated producers and smelters including scrap, ingot, metal in-process and finished products fell to 2,021,000 short tons in October from 2,090,000 short tons in September, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Primary production rose to 335,000 short tons in October from 322,000 short tons in September.</p>
<p>Net shipments were 646,000 short tons in October versus 776,000 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
